  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Bootstrap and Client State",
      "items": [
        "Home verifies the user, then bootstrap loads experts and sessions in parallel and fetches the active conversation.",
        "Dashboard coordinates session switching, useChat, optimistic updates, uploads, and debounced message sync.",
        "SessionsPanel exposes expert settings; ChatPanel composes ai-elements and shared ui components."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Persistence and Ownership",
      "items": [
        "Experts are shared. chat_sessions.user_id owns sessions; chat_messages inherit ownership through session_id and RLS.",
        "messages/sync upserts messages and updates titles, previews, and token totals. summarize=true triggers complete summary batches saved through an RPC.",
        "Saved summaries support storage and session search, and are excluded from chat context. Expert deletion uses a server admin client to remove all linked chats."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Context and Optional Capabilities",
      "items": [
        "Chat resolves the expert prompt, model, and reasoning effort. Referenced skills/ files extend instructions; tools include current server time and opt-in web_search.",
        "With history, Jev selects relevant conversation turns. A missing key, five-second timeout, or request failure falls back to the previous turn plus the current message.",
        "Audio routes proxy configured ASR and TTS services. Attachments upload first; public file URLs are then sent with the message."
      ]
    }
  ]
